{"id":"vod_sn_35627","vodId":"35627","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"奇幻怪盗","name_cn":"奇幻怪盗","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/57555ba44f1dcebf505cd2b6dfbf9630.jpg"},"summary":"不知火真（松冈祯丞 配音）是一名初中一年级的学生，从小，她就渴望成为一名奇术师。星里果菜（铃木爱奈 配音）是真青梅竹马的玩伴，而她的父亲正是大名鼎鼎的奇术师星里卫（细谷佳正 配音）。为了拜师学艺，真来到了里菜家中，这才发现原来里菜还有一个名叫梦未（富田美忧 配音）的家里蹲妹妹。　　因为星里卫因为要参加世界巡演，所以总是不在家，而里菜又是一个女子力为零的冒失鬼，于是，真在误打误撞之中成为了星里家的见习管家。城市里活跃着一位号称“幻幻”的魔法怪盗，而真对里菜的昵称也是“幻幻”，这两人之间是否有着千丝万缕的关联呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:19","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eejWFsxRB01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8svDPRcxNg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DfhFQRUj1E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y2fXKR6a991/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8XgvxGg9Cf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vxsh4hwZvF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bejq6nQnzu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mH0gbQvApS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/svSC1u2rCs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hFd4J3aEgV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/79aaSiWV8E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QsGYMwN01B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lys4CXw1ki1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.886Z"}